# Files under the assets directory (= repo root, see wrangler.jsonc) that
# Cloudflare must NOT upload. gitignore syntax; the file itself is not served.

# --- Staged, not yet published -------------------------------------------
# Interna Wissensraum media. Referenced only by interna.html, which is behind
# the session gate; while these are excluded that page shows missing media.
# Delete these three lines to publish them.
assets/audio/
assets/grundtoene/
assets/uebungen/

# --- Repo-internal: never part of the published site ---------------------
# The Worker serves the repo root verbatim, so anything not listed here is
# publicly fetchable by URL.
.assetsignore
.gitignore
.claude/
.specify/
specs/
files/
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
README.md
serve.py
wrangler.jsonc
*.pdf
